{{Term/Store|Snow Speed Up||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280|edition= Expanded Edition|year= 2018}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
In {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}, Snow Speed Up is an [[Added Effect]] found exclusively on the [[Snow Boots]] that removes the 20% movement speed penalty for moving on [[Snow]].

